{"kind":"stack","id":"shadows-stack","title":"Shadows: finding patterns in size","theme":{"background":"#fdf6e3","foreground":"#1f2937","font":"Georgia, serif"}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c1","kind":"flash","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c1-term","content":"Shadow"},{"type":"text","id":"c1-expl","content":"A dark shape made when an object blocks light from a light source."},{"type":"button","id":"c1-next","label":"Next Card","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c2"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c2","kind":"flash","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c2-term","content":"Light source"},{"type":"text","id":"c2-expl","content":"Something that gives out its own light, such as the sun or a torch."},{"type":"button","id":"c2-next","label":"Next Card","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c3"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c3","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c3-q","content":"If you move a torch closer to an object, what happens to its shadow?"},{"type":"button","id":"c3-a","label":"It gets smaller","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c3-b","label":"It gets bigger","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c3-c","label":"It stays the same size","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c4","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c4-q","content":"If you move an object further away from the light, what happens to its shadow?"},{"type":"button","id":"c4-a","label":"It gets bigger","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c4-b","label":"It disappears completely","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c4-c","label":"It gets smaller","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c5","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c5-q","content":"A shadow is made. Which change makes the shadow bigger?"},{"type":"button","id":"c5-a","label":"Moving the light source closer to the object","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c6"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c5-b","label":"Moving the light source further away","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c6"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c5-c","label":"Turning the object around","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c6"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c6","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"image","picto":"castle"},{"type":"text","id":"c6-t","content":"Ada is in the castle hall with a torch. She wants to make a huge shadow of her toy knight on the wall. Where should she put the torch?"},{"type":"button","id":"c6-a","label":"Close to the knight","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c7"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c6-b","label":"Far away from the knight","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c8"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c7","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c7-t","content":"Ada puts the torch close to the knight. The shadow on the wall is huge and fills the whole wall. She is delighted!"},{"type":"button","id":"c7-next","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c9"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c8","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c8-t","content":"Ada puts the torch far away. The shadow on the wall is tiny and hard to see. She moves the torch closer to try again."},{"type":"button","id":"c8-next","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c9"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c9","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c9-q","content":"What pattern did you find in the shadow story?"},{"type":"button","id":"c9-a","label":"The closer the light, the bigger the shadow","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c10"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c9-b","label":"The closer the light, the smaller the shadow","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c10"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c9-c","label":"Distance from the light makes no difference","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c10"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c10","kind":"end","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c10-h","content":"Well done! You found the pattern in shadow size."},{"type":"text","id":"c10-m","content":"Keep noticing shadows around you. The closer the light, the bigger the shadow, and the further away, the smaller."}],"actions":[]}}
